  "label": "User projected onto the woman in the bikini",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman in the bikini, as the meme uses her image and the text 'absolutely haram' to create a crude, sexualized pun that implies the user (or the viewer) is seeing something 'haram' or forbidden. This projection is implicit through the meme's framing, where the viewer is positioned as the one observing the scene and thus implicitly identifying with the perspective of the viewer who is 'seeing' the 'haram' content.",
